@page "/shipping-returns"

<PageTitle>Shipping &amp; Returns - OS Arkiv</PageTitle>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">Good to know</div>
        <h1 class="section__title" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">Shipping &amp; Returns</h1>

        <div class="prose" style="margin-top:2rem;">
            <p>
                Since many pieces in the archive are one-of-a-kind, we pack every order by hand
                and usually ship within 2–4 business days.
            </p>
            <p>
                Changed your mind? You have 14 days to return your purchase from the day you
                receive it, as long as it's returned in the same condition it was sent in.
            </p>
            <p>
                This page is a placeholder for the frontend flow — exact shipping and return
                pricing/terms will be added once payment and logistics are in place.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
